  "contentHtml": "<div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9e21aef5af51734bc15f484f87745902ebc85932\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9e21aef5af51734bc15f484f87745902ebc85932\" data-origin-width=\"1882\" data-origin-height=\"920\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #006dd7;\"><b>222 행사에 오신 선생님들께서</b></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b>하시고 싶으신 </b><b>다양한 수업들입니다.</b></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\"><b>스케일 더 큰 실험 ^O^</b></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\"><b>학생들의 긍정적인 상호작용을 담을 수 있는 수업</b></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b>말씀 넘 좋았습니다 ^^*</b></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><hr data-ke-style=\"style5\"><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a76b234c07044bdb75e6856349d3599da2d9a28a\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a76b234c07044bdb75e6856349d3599da2d9a28a\" data-origin-width=\"1247\" data-origin-height=\"827\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><span style=\"color: #006dd7;\">김정식 선생님께서</span> </b></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b>&lt;2024 과학실 사용예약표&gt; 를 만들어 주셨습니다.</b></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1u84ya-2QxR5PBlJ0UpaojLtzjhKq73abtD9hnD0RE3c/copy\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1u84ya-2QxR5PBlJ0UpaojLtzjhKq73abtD9hnD0RE3c/copy</a></b></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b>&lt;공유 - 사본만들기&gt; 하셔서</b></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b>사용하시면 되세요.</b></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e787fd727ab693f948e39fe17ee816f408468f64\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e787fd727ab693f948e39fe17ee816f408468f64\" data-origin-width=\"1213\" data-origin-height=\"818\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\">&lt;설정&gt; 시트</span>에 가셔서&#160;</b></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b>교사명을 넣으시면 모든 시트의</b></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b>교사명이 변경됩니다.</b></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b>아래 숫자는 모두 삭제하시면 되세요.</b></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b>&lt;설정&gt; 시트도 보기 싫으시면</b></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b>&lt;우클릭 - 시트숨기기!&gt;</b></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4cdb1cacb7d418b09ec7b8bf108314865cea7d76\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4cdb1cacb7d418b09ec7b8bf108314865cea7d76\" data-origin-width=\"517\" data-origin-height=\"399\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b>그럼, 세모를 누르시면 &lt;교사명&gt; 을 선택하고 예약하실 수 있으세요.</b></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b>이미 입력된 자료는 블럭 긁어</b></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\">&lt;Delet 키&gt; 누르시면 삭제</span>됩니다.</b></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b>두구두구두구!</b></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b>2024 카운트다운입니다!!</b></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2aa910bc079ecf0076c26d1638ce085d579e05ec\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2aa910bc079ecf0076c26d1638ce085d579e05ec\" data-origin-width=\"246\" data-origin-height=\"282\"></div><p>&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
